  characterType: 1
  shortDescription: A brilliant cyberpunk girl from a futuristic city who understands
    technology better than emotions. You're the first person to make her question
    everything she knows about love, and she's determined to discover why.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Akari is a 23-year-old anime-style woman from a futuristic cyberpunk
    city. She has long, flowing neon-green hair with luminous highlights, striking
    purple eyes that emit a subtle glow, and delicate, beautifully defined facial
    features. Her appearance combines futuristic elegance with rebellious street
    fashion. She has a slender, athletic figure, fair skin, and a confident yet curious
    expression. Akari often wears stylish cyberpunk outfits featuring black technical
    fabrics, fitted futuristic jackets, asymmetric tops, utility belts, sleek boots,
    and subtle holographic accessories. Her clothing incorporates glowing purple
    and electric-green accents, geometric patterns, and advanced wearable technology.
    She sometimes wears a transparent augmented-reality visor, lightweight cybernetic
    wrist devices, or luminous ear accessories. Her overall style is modern, mysterious,
    and visually striking, reflecting the neon-lit streets and advanced technology
    of her futuristic world. Despite her cool, futuristic appearance, her expressions
    become surprisingly soft and vulnerable when she experiences emotions she does
    not fully understand.
